            "description_html": "<b>Bommer BB5004-450-632, 4-1/2\" x 4-1/2\"  Heavy Duty Ball Bearing Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStandard commercial size quad (4) ball bearing door hinge. Heavy duty door hinge, .180\" thickness. Standard full mortise hinge with 5 knuckle design and button tips. BHMA certified architectural grade hinges. Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bommer-BB5004-450-hinge_size.gif?v=1704354684\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer BB5004-450 Hinge Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer BB5004-450-632:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: 632 <b>Bright Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>4 Ball Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.180\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: 4 ea. #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: 8 ea. #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified Hinge</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Removable Steel Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - Conforms to ANSI A8111 for Ball Bearing Hinges</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BB5004-450.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer BB5004-450 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with matching finish machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly (2)  Left.\r\n</p>",
